<p class="about-text">I'm Ben: a technologist, educator, and free software advocate who helps people solve problems with open technologies—from building technical solutions to growing communities of practice—because I believe you should own the technology you depend on.</p>
<p class="about-text">BNHR has been a QGIS sustaining member since 2020, helping fund the software I teach. I also co-founded SmartCT, a tech non-profit, and the Civic Literacy Initiative.</p>
